### Component 8: Memory Architecture

#### [NEW] [MemoryService.java](file:///b:/placement%20course/JAVA%20development/compliqMain/compliq/src/main/java/com/smit/compliq/service/MemoryService.java)
- **Episodic memory**: Recent chat history from `ChatMessageRepository` (last 10 messages in session)
- **Session memory**: Current conversation context (maintained in-memory during agent loop)
- **Long-term memory**: `UserMemory` entities — facts, preferences, context the user has shared across sessions
- **Memory creation policy**: LLM decides if something is worth remembering by including a `store_memory` tool call. The service validates: no duplicates, max 50 per user, max 500 chars per value, no sensitive data patterns (credit cards, SSNs, passwords redacted)
- **Memory retrieval**: keyword matching on `memoryKey` + `memoryValue`, returns top 5 most relevant

