### Component 9: Tracing & Cost Tracking

#### [NEW] [ChatbotTracingService.java](file:///b:/placement%20course/JAVA%20development/compliqMain/compliq/src/main/java/com/smit/compliq/service/ChatbotTracingService.java)
- Creates and persists `ChatbotTrace` entity after every chatbot execution
- Tracks: requestId, sessionId, userId, model name, prompt version, retrieved doc IDs, rerank results, tool calls (serialized as JSON), latency, token usage, failures, final response preview (truncated to 500 chars)
- **Cost calculation**: `(promptTokens * INPUT_COST_PER_TOKEN) + (completionTokens * OUTPUT_COST_PER_TOKEN)`
- Defaults: `INPUT_COST_PER_TOKEN = 0.00000015` ($0.15/1M), `OUTPUT_COST_PER_TOKEN = 0.0000006` ($0.60/1M)
- **Sanitization**: strips any string matching JWT pattern, API key patterns, or password fields before persisting to trace

