### Component 10: Failure Recovery

Built into `ChatbotAgentService` and `ToolExecutor`:

| Failure Type | Recovery Strategy |
|---|---|
| **Tool failure** | Catch exception, record in trace, inform agent "Tool X failed: [safe error message]", agent can retry or use alternative |
| **LLM failure** | Retry once with exponential backoff (2s). If 2nd attempt fails, return fallback response |
| **Retrieval failure** | If vector search fails, fall back to keyword-only search. If both fail, agent proceeds without context, clearly stating "I couldn't retrieve relevant documents" |
| **Malformed structured output** | JSON parse failure → send repair prompt (existing pattern from `GeminiAIService`). Max 2 retries |
| **Timeout/rate-limit** | Catch `TimeoutException` / HTTP 429 → wait 5s → retry once. If still failing, return "Service temporarily busy, please try again shortly" |
| **Partial agent execution** | If agent loop breaks mid-execution, persist whatever trace data we have, save partial conversation, return safe fallback |

